# Feralas - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 9 confirmed flagged rares of Feralas and
# its fixed world containers. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of
# the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not
# up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever
# game data (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE dropper
# is the rare, and two of the nine have none - they ship as kill goals with
# notes. Every rare here is a single confirmed point, so every step is a
# plain single-goto step (a loop needs at least two). No tame lines ship
# (the data has no tameability flag and the core guide carries no tame
# corroboration - see docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are
# unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. No rare in this guide is a
# giver, ender, or objective of any core-contracted quest. The three
# above-band Dire Maul rares (Mushgog, The Razza, Skarr) are deliberately
# excluded - see docs/feralas-companions-inventory.md.
guide butler-routes-completionist/feralas-rares
title Feralas - Rares & Treasures
levels 38-50
zone Feralas
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords feralas, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Arash-ethis — the north-center

  zone map 1444

  goto 44.79,25.02
  kill 5349 optional
  collect 284866 "Windserpent Scaled Cloak" optional
  note Level 49 rare wind serpent at its single confirmed point north of the center; its sole drop is the Windserpent Scaled Cloak. No quest takes it in the data.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

